            <ArticleTitle>Distinction of reactive joint fluid from pyogenic abscess by diffusion-weighted imaging.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>859-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It is difficult to distinguish reactive joint fluid from infectious joint fluid by conventional MR images. In this presented case, we successfully distinguished these two conditions using diffusion-weighted imaging.</AbstractText>
